# Audi A8 D5 four-door saloon, 2017 onwards.
#
# The fourth A8: the wider, sharper D5 body with the large single-frame
# grille, the OLED tail lamps and the mild-hybrid range. UK pricing was
# announced on 3 October 2017. The 2021 facelift is a colour-run change.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Audi_A8
#
# Dimensions 5.172 x 1.945 x 1.485 m, wheelbase 2.998 m.
#
# Shape reference: image 1 is an oblique rear-side view, not a true side
# profile; the front and rear three-quarters show the lamps and grille. The
# flank is estimated; the limitation is recorded.
#
# Colours: grade (d); no UK chart was established. Black, silver, grey and
# blue are plain names. Weights 9, 8, 7, 6, total 30, provisional.
#
# Speed 250 km/h. Comfort 108/342, on the line 180 + 1.5 x 108. Classes 3,4.
# Dates are road presence: 2017 intro, retires staggered 2041-2044.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/audi-a8-d5.blend. Interchange:
# citycars/4.5/audi-a8-d5.dae. References:
# citycars/references/audi-a8-d5/ (gitignored; Wikimedia Commons).
#
# Accepted deviations: no profile exists in the pack, so the flank is estimated.
# The rear-glass area is smaller than the photograph's, the full-width tail bar
# is a flat band without the inner lens graphics or corner wrap, and there is no
# shoulder scallop. At 128 px the very wide grille, slim lamps and full-width
# tail bar read as a D5 A8.


obj=citycar
